//  - FS == 0b000, which means:
//      - MCLK = 256*Fs,
//      - BICK = 128*Fs,
//      - Fs must fall within 8kHz <= Fs <= 48Khz.
// - TDM == 0b1 and DCF == 0b010, which means:
//      - TDM128 mode I2S compatible.
